@GradebookAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5049

### Get all Assessments by Course
GET {{GradebookAPI_HostAddress}}/v1/Assessments/GetByCourseId?courseId=123456
Accept: application/json

### Create a new Assessment
POST {{GradebookAPI_HostAddress}}/v1/Assessments/Create
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "CourseId": "123456",
  "Title": "A new assessment",
  "Category": "Test",
  "MaxScore": 30,
  "WeightPercentage": 30,
  "DueDate": null
}

### Get all Grades by Course
GET {{GradebookAPI_HostAddress}}/v1/Grades/GetByCourseId?courseId=12
Accept: application/json

### Create a new Grade
POST {{GradebookAPI_HostAddress}}/v1/Grades/Create
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "StudentId": "123456",
    "AssessmentId": "2307f294-03eb-4066-ba69-7afcdb593027",
    "Score": 0
}

###
